@startuml signal-processing-flow
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif

title Signal 层主处理链路（位置唯一主路径 / Lifecycle seeds / Stateless / Kalman / IMM）

rectangle "环境建模输入\n传播损耗 / 杂波 / 干扰" as ENV
rectangle "回波计算\nSignalDetector" as ECHO
rectangle "信号检测\nCFAR 探测判决" as DETECT
rectangle "Lifecycle 关联种子注入\nBuildAssociationSeeds → SetAssociationSeeds" as SEEDS
rectangle "数据关联\nDataAssociationEngine" as ASSOC
rectangle "位置空间关联\n预测位置 + 量测位置 + HPH^T + R" as POS_ASSOC
rectangle "跟踪滤波\nTrackFilter（标量特征）" as FILTER
rectangle "TrackMeasurement 导出\nSignalPipeline bridge" as MEAS
rectangle "轨迹管理\nTrackLifecycleManager" as LIFECYCLE
rectangle "关键路径摘要日志\nAssociation / Lifecycle / Controller" as LOGS

rectangle "状态估计\n(集成于 LifecycleManager)" as KALMAN {
  rectangle "新轨迹\n从量测初始化\nGaussianTrackState" as INIT
  rectangle "已有轨迹\nKalman: Predict → Update\nIMM: Process\n→ 写回 position/velocity" as PU
  rectangle "未命中轨迹\nKalman/IMM 仅 Predict\n协方差膨胀 + 均值外推" as PRED_ONLY
}

rectangle "稳定航迹快照\n供决策层/目标分类使用" as SNAPSHOT
rectangle "轨迹对象池\n仅内存复用" as POOL

ENV --> ECHO
ECHO --> DETECT
LIFECYCLE --> SEEDS
SEEDS --> ASSOC
DETECT --> ASSOC
ASSOC --> POS_ASSOC
ASSOC --> FILTER
FILTER --> MEAS
MEAS --> LIFECYCLE
LIFECYCLE --> KALMAN
KALMAN --> SNAPSHOT
LIFECYCLE --> POOL : 申请/归还对象
ASSOC --> LOGS
LIFECYCLE --> LOGS

note right of ASSOC
  输出 AssociationResult：
  - matches
  - missed_track_keys
  - unassociated_target_indices
  - target_keys
  - used_position_association
  - used_external_association_seeds

  仅支持位置空间主关联；
  成功探测目标若缺位置量测，
  直接触发契约失败。
end note

note right of SEEDS
  当 Controller / Pipeline 已显式注入
  外部 seeds 时，即便 seeds 为空，
  也表示 Lifecycle 已接管先验输入；
  关联侧保持 stateless，不复用内部历史先验。
end note

note right of FILTER
  标量特征维护：
  speed / RCS / acceleration
  的衰减和透传。
end note

note right of MEAS
  桥接接口：
  ISignalPipeline::GetLastTrackMeasurements()

  语义字段：
  - source_index, association_key
  - has_cartesian_position（Kalman / IMM 激活条件）
  - position, velocity（空间量测）
  - measurement_covariance（动态 R 矩阵）
end note

note right of KALMAN
  状态估计激活条件：
  1. Kalman predictor/updater 或 IMM 模型集已配置
  2. measurement.has_cartesian_position == true
end note

note right of POS_ASSOC
  external-seed 路径直接使用 Lifecycle 导出的
  高斯状态做预测；无 external seeds 时按 stateless 运行。
  逐轨迹 HPH^T 与逐量测 measurement_covariance(R)
  合成为 FullMahalanobisDistanceMetric 所需的 S。
  external seeds 缺失位置或高斯状态会直接契约失败。
end note

note right of LOGS
  当前已覆盖：
  - prior source / seeds 数量
  - matches / misses / newborns 摘要
  - lifecycle update / recycle 摘要
  - controller cycle summary
end note

note bottom of SNAPSHOT
  分类上游应依赖稳定快照，
  而不是单帧检测或关联结果。
end note

@enduml
